            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " An enemy casts a spell that targets you or an ally within 15 feet of you"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You interpose your shield's ward against the spell. Attempt a counteract check, using your Religion modifier as your counteract modifier. On a success, the spell is counteracted and your shield takes damage equal to four times the spell rank as it absorbs and disperses the magical energy. On a failure, the shield takes damage equal to twice the spell's rank."
          }
        ]
      }
